Offer Bypass permissions in a running Claude session's permission picker.

The composer's picker listed Manual, Auto, Accept edits and Plan only, so a
session in bypass showed no selected mode, and one that left bypass couldn't
be switched back from the web UI. Needs images/server/patches/0007 and
images/runner/patches/0003.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d).

